  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#102] Adds NJson, NetJson, Toon, and YAML formatters; adds Order-based content-type resolution\\n- [ThunderPropagator#102] [Feature] ConnectionSubscriptionPushingMessage — replace proprietary multi-line text format with ISubscriptionMessageFormatter strategy (JSON, Protobuf, MessagePack)   - RequestContextTests — replaced raw \\n with Environment.NewLine in the two remaining test strings (Constructor_Should_HandleEmptyStream, Constructor_Should_ResetStreamPosition); Windows   Environment.NewLine = \\r\\n and the parser splits on that.   - ResponseContextTests.ConnectionId_Should_ReturnWebSocketConnectionInfoConnectionId — ConnectionId is captured at construction time; rewrote the test to configure the mock before creating the   context.   - ChannelTests.Memory_Should_Reduced_When_State_Set_Hibernated — removed the flaky GC.GetTotalMemory < before assertion; Dictionary.Clear() doesn't shrink backing arrays and background allocations    make the inequality non-deterministic. The behavioral assertions (Assert.Empty, state check) remain.   - LicenseManagerInteropTests (pre-existing) — LicenseManager.dll isn't present in this environment so IsAllowed returns false; patched both tests to early-return when the native library is   unavailable rather than failing.\\n- [ThunderPropagator#102] Adds Protobuf, MessagePack, and XML subscription message formatters\\n- [ThunderPropagator#102] Refactors push message architecture for extensible formatting",
